      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. it's a bit thin though. can you expand on the 'potential cons' section specifically? i need more detail on what the industry experts are actually worried about regarding the cost implications and the job relocation risks. \n\nagain, please don't sugarcoat it just because of that positivity score. i'm looking for the gritty details on why this might fail or cause economic friction. be as thorough as possible on the downsides.",
